先 `npm run build` 产出 `lib/`，再以依赖方式引入本包（或直接指向 `lib/index.js`）：

```ts
import { createEngine } from 'dsh-usage-board'

// ctx 为结构化 HostContext，无需真实 Cordis 运行时
const engine = createEngine(ctx, { dbPath, sessionsRoot })

---

Run `npm run build` to produce `lib/`, then depend on this package (or point straight at `lib/index.js`):

```ts
import { createEngine } from 'dsh-usage-board'

// ctx is a structured HostContext — no real Cordis runtime needed
const engine = createEngine(ctx, { dbPath, sessionsRoot })

---
